      "message": "feat(ui): viewport bottom control bar holds the view buttons\n\nThe five view buttons that stacked under the view cube (frame, iso,\nshaded/wireframe, toolpaths, world axes) move into a rounded, grey\nribbon floating over the bottom edge of the 3D viewport. The cube stays\ntop-right. The ribbon and its glyphs move to viewport_bar.rs; the buttons\nkeep their effects.\n\nRefs #1198\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
