      "message": "fix(ui): the view ribbon moves to the bottom-left, clear of the control legend\n\nThe ribbon was centred on the bottom edge and sat on the bottom-right\ncontrol legend on panes narrower than about 780 px. It now rests on the\nleft corner; the legend keeps the bottom-right. The legend string and its\nanchor are shared with the shell, and a test measures the legend against\nthe ribbon on a 700 x 600 and a 1600 x 900 pane.\n\nRefs #1198\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
