      "message": "fix(ui): the view ribbon is bottom-centre; the legend and empty-document line give way\n\nThe maintainer refused the bottom-left placement (\"it should have been\nbottom-center floating ontop of the 3D viewer\"). The ribbon is centred on\nthe bottom edge again. One pure layout (viewport_layout::place) places the\nribbon, the control legend and the empty-document line from the pane, the\nview cube and the frame-measured text sizes: the legend lifts onto its own\nline above the ribbon where it would meet it, the empty-document line lifts\nabove the ribbon and the legend, and a piece that would meet the cube or\nleave the pane is not drawn. Text wraps to the pane at the hud's minimum.\n\nRefs #1198\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
